  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 702d2e93d0a019a40b6339daf41e2c2f, type: 3}
  m_Name: BringTorHome
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SafeHaven::QuestDefinition
  id: rescue.tor
  displayName: Planks, Not Logs
  description: 'Logs are heavy and good for little: shields, walls and a dry shed all want planks, and a hatchet won''t make them. Bjarne says Tor, the expedition''s carpenter, was thrown into the deep woods with a broken leg. Listen for a saw where nobody saws, and bring him home.'
  chain: The Lost Expedition
  journalNotes: 'Bjarne blazed the trees on the way in and found his marks on the wrong side of them coming out: the roots move the road at night. Tor''s leg is broken, so he is slow. Planks start with him: palisades, the shed and the watch post all want them.'
